OL,3,GNEWSAEx-England boss joins Kevin
OL,4,ASinfield on MND run
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Kevin Sinfield was joined by his
OL,7,Ffriend and former England football
OL,8,Fmanager Sir Gareth Southgate on the
OL,9,Ffirst day of his final challenge to
OL,10,Fraise awareness for Motor Neurone
OL,11,FDisease (MND).
OL,13,FSinfield is aiming to complete seven
OL,14,Fultramarathons in seven days in memory
OL,15,Fof his former Leeds Rhinos teammate Rob
OL,16,FBurrow CBE, who died from MND in June
OL,17,F2024.
OL,19,FThe challenge will see him visit all 12
OL,20,FSuper League clubs before arriving in
OL,21,FManchester for the Grand Final on 3
OL,22,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
