OL,3,GNEWSAEx-England boss joins Kevin
OL,4,ASinfield on MND run
OL,5,
OL,6,FStarting at Hull's Craven Park stadium
OL,7,Fearlier, Sinfield thanked supporters
OL,8,Fwho had lined the East Yorkshire route
OL,9,Fon day one, while Southgate described
OL,10,Fthe experience as "brilliant".
